        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno atimo cik, nia ku ba kodhidhanu ceke, man thek ceke, ku dhok, ma biyero lem cac moko kum Mungu pa Cadrak, ku Mecak, man Abed-nego, jubithume nziki nziki, man udi migi jubidwoko ni udhuru mi weyo; kum mungu mange robe ma copo bodho calu maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
